Samples for XLSXClass.prg

  XLSXWriter.prg  - values of all types, styles, header/footer, merged cells, a picture, two sheets -> sample.xlsx
  XLSXReader.prg  - reads values from sample.xlsx (run xlsxwriter first)
  XLSXReport.prg  - printable report: formats, totals with formulas, page setup -> report.xlsx
  XLSXChart.prg   - column, line, horizontal bar and pie charts -> charts.xlsx

Build:
  hbmk2 xlsxwriter.hbp
  hbmk2 xlsxreader.hbp
  hbmk2 xlsxreport.hbp
  hbmk2 xlsxchart.hbp
